<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - June 25.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - June 25.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 GMT, in Sterling a tonne.</p>
<p>Feed Wheat to Liverpool July 85.00, 86.00, Norfolk/Suffolk July 83.50.</p>
</text>
